# Production endpoints, committed on purpose.
#
# These are the `HttpApiUrl` and `WebSocketUrl` outputs of the groupnetwork-prod
# SAM stack. They are public — every browser that loads the app learns them — so
# keeping them here rather than in CI variables makes a production build
# reproducible from a checkout alone, and removes the failure mode where an
# unset CI variable silently builds an app that points at nothing.
#
# Secrets are never in this file. They live in SSM under /groupnetwork/prod/ and
# reach the backend as stack parameters at deploy time.
VITE_API_BASE=https://im9u3gu1ki.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod
VITE_WS_URL=wss://bfu8kehim1.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod
